{"3196150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lami: A Cup of Code and Coffee", "steam_appid": 3196150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/26f6a56563dcae2d2444d1edf080aceb.avif?t=1782737299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras_big/26f6a56563dcae2d2444d1edf080aceb.webp?t=1782737299 width=1560 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You were once a young person exhausted by the daily grind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>After receiving news of your grandfather's passing, you quit your job and returned to the seaside town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You inherited an old cafe filled with memories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>While you thought this was just a fresh start, while tidying up the shop...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You accidentally awakened &quot;Lami,&quot; a robot girl left behind by your grandfather.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>From that day on, you and Lami began your life together,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Facing the unsolved mysteries hidden behind this cafe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/bc628e1e7d714e756a039f865c75f823.avif?t=1782737299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras_big/bc628e1e7d714e756a039f865c75f823.webp?t=1782737299 width=1560 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run the Cafe with Lami</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/06d5addace15c7bd9f09b1ebd9081fa2.poster.avif?t=1782737299\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/06d5addace15c7bd9f09b1ebd9081fa2.webm?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/06d5addace15c7bd9f09b1ebd9081fa2.mp4?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Greet customers, prepare meals, and bring life back to this quiet old shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Adjust the layout, purchase furniture, and optimize the workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Slowly transform the cafe into the space you’ve always dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As business gets on track, more customers and stories will find their way into your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Craft Equipment to Improve Efficiency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/f2f130a1a5701156659abef86833477f.poster.avif?t=1782737299\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/f2f130a1a5701156659abef86833477f.webm?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/f2f130a1a5701156659abef86833477f.mp4?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Running a cafe is about more than just serving coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather materials and craft tools to make your work more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From simple upgrades to new devices that save you time,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step by step, turn the old shop into a convenient and unique space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience the Life of a Coder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.poster.avif?t=1782737299\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.webm?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/1e57e682e8f2eb60d33b2a0862c25967.mp4?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a former engineer, you’ll use your skills to solve problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow the music to complete challenges in rhythm-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Develop new features and repair broken systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn coding from a source of stress into a way to move the cafe forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore Beyond the Town with Lami</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/17d289e3eeb6a8c46d08e049a5bea498.poster.avif?t=1782737299\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/17d289e3eeb6a8c46d08e049a5bea498.webm?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/17d289e3eeb6a8c46d08e049a5bea498.mp4?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beyond the cafe, even more places await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step outside the town with Lami to explore forests, lakesides, and unknown regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Search for materials, solve incidents, and gradually uncover the truth your grandfather left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some sights are beautiful, but some places are far from safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When strange lights appear in the sky, your peaceful life may be shattered by a sudden crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face Emergencies Side-by-Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/dc1e65f68a15a7680bb30312d52f2b90.poster.avif?t=1782737299\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/dc1e65f68a15a7680bb30312d52f2b90.webm?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/dc1e65f68a15a7680bb30312d52f2b90.mp4?t=1782737299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lami is more than just a helper; she is a partner who ventures with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the story unfolds, you will encounter haywire machines and sudden disasters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Along with the troubles lurking behind the cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work together with Lami to protect the life you’ve worked so hard to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Lami: A Cup of Code and Coffee&quot; is a 3D casual game combining cafe management, crafting, exploration, rhythm gameplay, and story-driven adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If you enjoy relaxing management and growing alongside characters while uncovering secrets,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Then this cafe is waiting for you to open its doors.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras/26f6a56563dcae2d2444d1edf080aceb.avif?t=1782737299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196150/extras_big/26f6a56563dcae2d2444d1edf080aceb.webp?t=1782737299 width=1560 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You were once a young person exhausted by the daily grind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-alig